# So You're About to Read Grounded Duality Theory

### A companion, a guide, and — if you never open the real thing — enough on its own

*Updated for v3.0.0*

---

Hey there. Glad you made it.

If you're holding this, one of two things is true. Either you're about to read the full Grounded Duality Theory document and you'd like a map before you go in, or you're not going to read it and you'd still like to know what it says. This is built for both. Nothing here requires the other document, and everything here points at where in that document the real version lives.

A promise about what this is: **simple on purpose.** The full theory argues with itself constantly, flags its own weak points, and lists what it can't do yet. That's the right way to write a theory and the wrong way to explain one. So I've taken all of that out. If a claim below sounds more confident than it should, that's me being simple, not me being sure. The real document does the doubting.

One thing before we start. This is a theory about what it takes to be a *someone* — to have there be something it is like to be you. You already are one. So you have the odd advantage of being the thing under discussion, and you can check most of this against your own experience as you go. Please do. That's the point.

