## The whole claim, before we build up to it

> **To be a someone, you have to be divided, and the division has to touch something that isn't you.**

That's it. *Duality* is the first half. *Grounded* is the second. Everything else is working out what those two words require.

You may find that anticlimactic. Good. Most of the value in this theory isn't the claim, it's what falls out of taking it seriously.

