## Where the theory stops and starts

That table is also where Part 1 ends and Part 2 begins, and it's a cleaner line than it used to be.

**Part 1 is the left column.** Four operations, four movements, no closure. Perception, feeling, thinking, reacting. A system can do all of that and there's nobody home.

**Part 2 is the right column.** Everything on that side requires the circle to close.

Earlier versions of the theory said "Part 1 stops before consciousness" and asked you to take it on faith. Now the line is somewhere you can point at.

